{"full":"hf:MeraTeddBohutBaddaHe/minimax-h3-ultra-fast","spaceId":"MeraTeddBohutBaddaHe/minimax-h3-ultra-fast","name":"MiniMax-H3 Ultra Fast","source":"huggingface","description":"Ultra-fast local NVFP4 video + synchronized audio generation","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":7,"created":"2026-08-05T15:10:58.000Z","updated":"2026-08-05T15:16:22.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://merateddbohutbaddahe-minimax-h3-ultra-fast.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/MeraTeddBohutBaddaHe/minimax-h3-ultra-fast","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:02:51.132Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T05:02:51.132Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T05:02:51.132Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"⚡","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Joint video and synchronized sound from MiniMax-H3, rebuilt for a single 96 GB Blackwell ZeroGPU worker.","MiniMax-H3's published model card notes that about 13B parameters live in AdaLN-related branches and that their outputs can be precomputed for inference. The pruned checkpoint makes that concrete: it samples the shared timestep embedding curve at 1025 points and linearly interpolates an 8-value coordinate for each requested timestep. Every block's modulation projection consequently becomes [96768, 8] instead of [96768, 2688].","The four large matrices in each of the 50 blocks—fused QKV, attention output, MLP up/gate and MLP down—are NVFP4. The modulation curve, norms, embeddings, biases and final heads stay at higher precision."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/MeraTeddBohutBaddaHe/minimax-h3-ultra-fast/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f907d8b241ef90ad2d93e8eea7177f829658feb0e999b3dd4c427d30c57c36a5","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:29:57.494Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:02:51.208Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Joint video and synchro